This product is derived from "molly-multi-tenant"
(https://github.com/thousmile/molly-multi-tenant), Copyright Wang Chen Chen,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from the original project include: renaming of the Java packages
(com.xaaef.molly -> com.abhishek.tenanthub), Maven modules and deployment artifacts;
upgrades to Spring Boot 3.5, Lombok and springdoc with JDK 23+ build support;
externalized Docker Compose credentials; English documentation; and CI.

The web front-ends are based on "v3-admin-vite"
(https://github.com/un-pany/v3-admin-vite), licensed under the MIT License.

India administrative area data (server/.../sql/india_area.sql, */src/assets/IndiaArea.json)
is derived from the Local Government Directory (LGD), Ministry of Panchayati Raj,
Government of India, via https://ramseraph.github.io/opendata/lgd/ .
Regenerate it with scripts/india-area/generate.mjs.
